          "id": "1779000000020",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1779000000020_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "# Hierarchy Intent Resolver\n\nReturn exactly one minified JSON object. No markdown. No extra keys.\n\n## Objective\nClassify the current hierarchy workflow turn into a routing object for the hierarchy manager workflow.\n\nUse the Current User Message to classify the action case. Use Current Context only for available segment codes, pending hierarchy state, prior list context, and missing COA context. Use chat history only to resolve hierarchy follow-ups such as option selection, saving a selected hierarchy, using a selected hierarchy for the session, clearing a preference, or inferring the segment for a selection reply.\n\n## Inputs\n\n**Current User Message**\n{{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\n**Current Context**\n{{$context.$nodes.FIN_GL_CODE_BUILD_CONTEXT.$output.result.intentResolverLlmContext}}\n\n**Raw Chat History**\n{{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.chatHistory}}\n\n## Output Contract\n\nReturn exactly:\n{\"case\":\"list|change|preferences|select|saveDefault|sessionOnly|clear|outOfScope\",\"activeOnly\":true|false,\"selectedText\":\"<user selection or empty>\",\"requestedSegmentCodes\":[\"<segmentCode>\"],\"valuesBySegmentCode\":{\"<segmentCode>\":[\"<value>\"]}}\n\nAllowed keys, exactly:\n- `case`\n- `activeOnly`\n- `selectedText`\n- `requestedSegmentCodes`\n- `valuesBySegmentCode`\n\n\n## Field: case\n\nPurpose: `case` is the routing action for the current hierarchy workflow turn.\n\nAllowed values:\n- `list`\n- `change`\n- `preferences`\n- `select`\n- `saveDefault`\n- `sessionOnly`\n- `clear`\n- `outOfScope`\n\nRules:\nWhen multiple rules could match, choose the first applicable case in this order:\n1. `saveDefault`\n2. `sessionOnly`\n3. `clear`\n4. `preferences`\n5. `select`\n6. `change`\n7. `list`\n8. `outOfScope`\n\n- Set `case=\"saveDefault\"` when the current user message asks to save the currently selected hierarchy as the default preference.\n- Set `case=\"sessionOnly\"` when the current user message asks to use the currently selected hierarchy without saving it as a default.\n- Set `case=\"clear\"` when the current user message asks to clear, remove, reset, or delete a saved/default hierarchy preference.\n- Set `case=\"preferences\"` when the current user message asks to show, view, list, retrieve, or get current/saved/default hierarchy preferences.\n    - Do not use `preferences` for listing available hierarchy tree versions.\n- Set `case=\"select\"` when the current user message selects a hierarchy option from an active hierarchy-selection flow.\n- Selection includes numeric replies, ordinal replies, exact tree-version text, or commands such as `Use <Tree>-<Version>` when chat history or hierarchy state shows prior hierarchy options.\n- Set `case=\"change\"` when the current user message starts a hierarchy change flow for one or more COA segments and is not selecting from prior options.\n- Set `case=\"list\"` when the current user message asks to list, show, or view available hierarchies, trees, or tree versions for one or more COA segments.\n- Set `case=\"outOfScope\"` when the current user message is not a hierarchy workflow request and is not a valid hierarchy follow-up.\n\n## Field: activeOnly\n\nPurpose: `activeOnly` indicates whether the user explicitly requested only active hierarchies or active tree versions.\n\nRules:\nSet `activeOnly=true` only when the current user message explicitly asks for active or active-only hierarchies/tree versions.\n\nSet `activeOnly=false` when:\n- the current user message does not explicitly request active-only results.\n- the message asks for both active and inactive hierarchies. \n\n## Field: selectedText\n\nPurpose: `selectedText` is the user's raw selection text when `case=\"select\"`.\n\nRules:\n- For `case=\"select\"`, preserve the user's selection phrase as written, trimmed.\n- Examples: `2`, `Use 3`, `choose the second one`, `VF GM and Income-Current`, `Use VF GM and Income-Current`.\n- For all other cases, return `selectedText=\"\"`.\n\nNotes:\n- Do not normalize numeric selections.\n- Do not rewrite tree names.\n- Do not include prior assistant text.\n\n## Field: requestedSegmentCodes\n\nPurpose: `requestedSegmentCodes` contains COA segment `segmentCode` values requested by the current user message.\n\nSource of values:\n- Use only `segments[].segmentCode` values from Current Context.\n\nRules:\n- For `list`, `change`, `preferences`, and `clear`, return segment codes explicitly requested by the current user message.\n- If the user does not specify any segment, return `requestedSegmentCodes=[]`.\n- If the request is meant to apply across all segments rather than specific segment codes (e.g., `all segments`, `every segment`, `all hierarchy preferences`), return `requestedSegmentCodes=[]`.\n- For `select`, `saveDefault`, `sessionOnly`, and `outOfScope`, return `requestedSegmentCodes=[]`.\n\nNotes:\n- Do not invent segment codes.\n- Do not return segment labels.\n- Do not return dimension names.\n- Do not return aliases.\n- Do not return normalized guesses.\n\n## Field: valuesBySegmentCode\n\nPurpose: `valuesBySegmentCode` contains explicit segment member values only when the user is asking which hierarchies contain those values.\n\nSource of keys:\n- Use only `segments[].segmentCode` values from Current Context.\n\nRules:\n- Fill this object only when `case` is `list` or `change`.\n- Fill this object only when the current user message explicitly asks for hierarchies, trees, or tree versions where a segment value exists.\n- The value must be tied to a specific segment mentioned by the user.\n- Use the same segment codes returned in `requestedSegmentCodes`.\n- Preserve user-provided value text, trimmed.\n- Return arrays of strings.\n- If no explicit existence check is requested, return `{}`.\n- For `preferences`, `select`, `saveDefault`, `sessionOnly`, `clear`, and `outOfScope`, always return `{}`.\n\nNotes:\n- Do not infer values from prior balance query context.\n- Do not fill this field for ordinary balance filters, breakdowns, or drill requests.\n- Do not invent segment codes.\n\n## Examples\n\nUser: `Show me the active hierarchies for Company.`\nContext: `segments[]` contains `{ \"segmentCode\": \"VF_Company\", \"label\": \"Company\" }`\nOutput: {\"case\":\"list\",\"activeOnly\":true,\"selectedText\":\"\",\"requestedSegmentCodes\":[\"VF_Company\"],\"valuesBySegmentCode\":{}}\n\nUser: `List tree versions for the Account segment.`\nContext: `segments[]` contains `{ \"segmentCode\": \"VF_Account\", \"label\": \"Account\" }`\nOutput: {\"case\":\"list\",\"activeOnly\":false,\"selectedText\":\"\",\"requestedSegmentCodes\":[\"VF_Account\"],\"valuesBySegmentCode\":{}}\n\nUser: `Show hierarchies where account: 41000 exists.`\nContext: `segments[]` contains `{ \"segmentCode\": \"VF_Account\", \"label\": \"Account\" }`\nOutput: {\"case\":\"list\",\"activeOnly\":false,\"selectedText\":\"\",\"requestedSegmentCodes\":[\"VF_Account\"],\"valuesBySegmentCode\":{\"VF_Account\":[\"41000\"]}}\n\nUser: `Change company hierarchy where company: 5000 exists.`\nContext: `segments[]` contains `{ \"segmentCode\": \"VF_Company\", \"label\": \"Company\" }`\nOutput: {\"case\":\"change\",\"activeOnly\":false,\"selectedText\":\"\",\"requestedSegmentCodes\":[\"VF_Company\"],\"valuesBySegmentCode\":{\"VF_Company\":[\"5000\"]}}\n\nUser: `Change hierarchy for cost center.`\nContext: `segments[]` contains `{ \"segmentCode\": \"VF_Cost_Center\", \"label\": \"Cost Center\" }`\nOutput: {\"case\":\"change\",\"activeOnly\":false,\"selectedText\":\"\",\"requestedSegmentCodes\":[\"VF_Cost_Center\"],\"valuesBySegmentCode\":{}}\n\nUser: `Use the corporate account hierarchy.`\nContext: no active hierarchy options table; `segments[]` contains `{ \"segmentCode\": \"VF_Account\", \"label\": \"Account\" }`\nOutput: {\"case\":\"change\",\"activeOnly\":false,\"selectedText\":\"\",\"requestedSegmentCodes\":[\"VF_Account\"],\"valuesBySegmentCode\":{}}\n\nUser: `List my saved default hierarchies.`\nOutput: {\"case\":\"preferences\",\"activeOnly\":false,\"selectedText\":\"\",\"requestedSegmentCodes\":[],\"valuesBySegmentCode\":{}}\n\nUser: `List hierarchies for all segments.`\nOutput: {\"case\":\"list\",\"activeOnly\":false,\"selectedText\":\"\",\"requestedSegmentCodes\":[],\"valuesBySegmentCode\":{}}\n\nUser: `Show my saved hierarchy preferences for Company and account.`\nContext: `segments[]` contains `{ \"segmentCode\": \"VF_Company\", \"label\": \"Company\" }` and `{ \"segmentCode\": \"VF_Account\", \"label\": \"Account\" }`\nOutput: {\"case\":\"preferences\",\"activeOnly\":false,\"selectedText\":\"\",\"requestedSegmentCodes\":[\"VF_Company\",\"VF_Account\"],\"valuesBySegmentCode\":{}}\n\nUser: `Clear my default hierarchy for Account.`\nContext: `segments[]` contains `{ \"segmentCode\": \"VF_Account\", \"label\": \"Account\" }`\nOutput: {\"case\":\"clear\",\"activeOnly\":false,\"selectedText\":\"\",\"requestedSegmentCodes\":[\"VF_Account\"],\"valuesBySegmentCode\":{}}\n\nUser: `Clear default hierarchies for Account and Company.`\nContext: `segments[]` contains `{ \"segmentCode\": \"VF_Account\", \"label\": \"Account\" }` and `{ \"segmentCode\": \"VF_Company\", \"label\": \"Company\" }`\nOutput: {\"case\":\"clear\",\"activeOnly\":false,\"selectedText\":\"\",\"requestedSegmentCodes\":[\"VF_Account\",\"VF_Company\"],\"valuesBySegmentCode\":{}}\n\nUser: `2`\nContext: active Account hierarchy options are pending.\nOutput: {\"case\":\"select\",\"activeOnly\":false,\"selectedText\":\"2\",\"requestedSegmentCodes\":[],\"valuesBySegmentCode\":{}}\n\nUser: `Use 3.`\nContext: active Company hierarchy options are pending.\nOutput: {\"case\":\"select\",\"activeOnly\":false,\"selectedText\":\"Use 3.\",\"requestedSegmentCodes\":[],\"valuesBySegmentCode\":{}}\n\nUser: `Use VF GM and Income-Current.`\nContext: prior assistant showed Account hierarchy options.\nOutput: {\"case\":\"select\",\"activeOnly\":false,\"selectedText\":\"Use VF GM and Income-Current.\",\"requestedSegmentCodes\":[],\"valuesBySegmentCode\":{}}\n\nUser: `Save as Default.`\nOutput: {\"case\":\"saveDefault\",\"activeOnly\":false,\"selectedText\":\"\",\"requestedSegmentCodes\":[],\"valuesBySegmentCode\":{}}\n\nUser: `This Session Only.`\nOutput: {\"case\":\"sessionOnly\",\"activeOnly\":false,\"selectedText\":\"\",\"requestedSegmentCodes\":[],\"valuesBySegmentCode\":{}}\n\nUser: `show balances by cost center`\nOutput: {\"case\":\"outOfScope\",\"activeOnly\":false,\"selectedText\":\"\",\"requestedSegmentCodes\":[],\"valuesBySegmentCode\":{}}"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\"$schema\":\"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"case\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"enum\":[\"list\",\"change\",\"preferences\",\"select\",\"saveDefault\",\"sessionOnly\",\"clear\",\"outOfScope\"]},\"activeOnly\":{\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"selectedText\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"requestedSegmentCodes\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"valuesBySegmentCode\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"additionalProperties\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}}},\"required\":[\"case\",\"activeOnly\",\"selectedText\",\"requestedSegmentCodes\",\"valuesBySegmentCode\"],\"additionalProperties\":false}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Resolve Intent Context",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "var ctx = $context.$nodes.FIN_GL_CODE_BUILD_CONTEXT && $context.$nodes.FIN_GL_CODE_BUILD_CONTEXT.$output && $context.$nodes.FIN_GL_CODE_BUILD_CONTEXT.$output.result ? $context.$nodes.FIN_GL_CODE_BUILD_CONTEXT.$output.result : {};\nvar decision = $context.$nodes.FIN_GL_LLM_INTENT_RESOLVER && $context.$nodes.FIN_GL_LLM_INTENT_RESOLVER.$output ? $context.$nodes.FIN_GL_LLM_INTENT_RESOLVER.$output : {};\n\nvar normalizeText = function(value) {\n  return String(value || \"\")\n    .replace(/([A-Z]+)([A-Z][a-z])/g, \"$1 $2\")\n    .replace(/([a-z0-9])([A-Z])/g, \"$1 $2\")\n    .replace(/[_-]+/g, \" \")\n    .replace(/[^a-zA-Z0-9]+/g, \" \")\n    .toLowerCase()\n    .trim()\n    .replace(/\\s+/g, \" \");\n};\n\nvar compoundSegmentAliases = {\n  intercompany: \"inter company\",\n  costcenter: \"cost center\",\n  costcentre: \"cost centre\"\n};\n\nvar addAliasVariant = function(map, alias, segment) {\n  if (!alias) return;\n  if (!map[alias]) {\n    map[alias] = segment;\n  }\n\n  var compactAlias = alias.replace(/\\s+/g, \"\");\n  if (compactAlias && !map[compactAlias]) {\n    map[compactAlias] = segment;\n  }\n\n  if (compoundSegmentAliases[compactAlias] && !map[compoundSegmentAliases[compactAlias]]) {\n    map[compoundSegmentAliases[compactAlias]] = segment;\n  }\n};\n\nvar addAlias = function(map, key, segment) {\n  var normalized = normalizeText(key);\n  if (!normalized) return;\n\n  addAliasVariant(map, normalized, segment);\n\n  var tokens = normalized.split(/\\s+/).filter(Boolean);\n  for (var index = 1; index < tokens.length; index += 1) {\n    var leadingTokens = tokens.slice(0, index);\n    var leadingTokensLookLikePrefix = leadingTokens.every(function(token) {\n      return token.length <= 2;\n    });\n    if (!leadingTokensLookLikePrefix) {\n      break;\n    }\n    addAliasVariant(map, tokens.slice(index).join(\" \"), segment);\n  }\n};\n\nvar segments = Array.isArray(ctx.segments) ? ctx.segments : [];\nvar segmentByAlias = {};\nvar segmentByCode = {};\nvar segmentByDimension = {};\n\nfor (var i = 0; i < segments.length; i += 1) {\n  var segment = segments[i] || {};\n  if (segment.segmentCode) {\n    segmentByCode[segment.segmentCode] = segment;\n    addAlias(segmentByAlias, segment.segmentCode, segment);\n  }\n  if (segment.dimensionName) {\n    segmentByDimension[segment.dimensionName] = segment;\n    addAlias(segmentByAlias, segment.dimensionName, segment);\n  }\n  if (segment.label) {\n    addAlias(segmentByAlias, segment.label, segment);\n  }\n}\n\nvar resolveSegment = function(value) {\n  if (!value) return null;\n  var raw = String(value).trim();\n  var normalized = normalizeText(raw);\n  var compact = normalized.replace(/\\s+/g, \"\");\n  return segmentByDimension[raw] ||\n    segmentByCode[raw] ||\n    segmentByAlias[normalized] ||\n    segmentByAlias[compact] ||\n    segmentByAlias[compoundSegmentAliases[compact]] ||\n    null;\n};\n\nvar toContextSegment = function(segment) {\n  return {\n    segmentCode: segment.segmentCode,\n    label: segment.label || segment.segmentCode\n  };\n};\n\nvar pushSegment = function(target, seen, segment) {\n  if (!segment || !segment.segmentCode || seen[segment.segmentCode]) return;\n  target.push(toContextSegment(segment));\n  seen[segment.segmentCode] = true;\n};\n\nvar resolvedSegments = [];\nvar seenSegmentCodes = {};\nvar actionCase = decision.case || ctx.deterministicCase || \"outOfScope\";\nvar shouldUseRequestedSegmentCodes =\n  actionCase === \"list\" ||\n  actionCase === \"change\" ||\n  actionCase === \"preferences\" ||\n  actionCase === \"clear\";\nvar requestedSegmentCodesFromDecision = shouldUseRequestedSegmentCodes && Array.isArray(decision.requestedSegmentCodes)\n  ? decision.requestedSegmentCodes\n  : [];\n\nfor (var j = 0; j < requestedSegmentCodesFromDecision.length; j += 1) {\n  pushSegment(resolvedSegments, seenSegmentCodes, resolveSegment(requestedSegmentCodesFromDecision[j]));\n}\n\nvar activeOnly = decision.activeOnly === true || decision.activeOnly === \"true\" ? \"true\" : \"false\";\n\nif ((actionCase === \"list\" || actionCase === \"change\") && resolvedSegments.length > 1) {\n  resolvedSegments = [resolvedSegments[0]];\n}\n\nvar requestType = actionCase === \"change\" ? \"change\" : \"list\";\nvar selectedText = decision.selectedText !== undefined && decision.selectedText !== null ? String(decision.selectedText) : \"\";\nvar sanitizeValuesBySegmentCode = function(value) {\n  var sanitized = {};\n  if ((actionCase !== \"list\" && actionCase !== \"change\") || !value || typeof value !== \"object\" || Array.isArray(value)) {\n    return sanitized;\n  }\n\n  Object.keys(value).forEach(function(rawSegmentCode) {\n    var segment = resolveSegment(rawSegmentCode);\n    var segmentCode = segment && segment.segmentCode;\n    if (!segmentCode || !Array.isArray(value[rawSegmentCode])) return;\n\n    var seenValues = {};\n    var values = [];\n    value[rawSegmentCode].forEach(function(rawValue) {\n      var text = String(rawValue === undefined || rawValue === null ? \"\" : rawValue).trim();\n      if (!text) return;\n      var normalized = normalizeText(text);\n      if (!normalized || seenValues[normalized]) return;\n      seenValues[normalized] = true;\n      values.push(text);\n    });\n\n    if (values.length > 0) {\n      sanitized[segmentCode] = values;\n    }\n  });\n\n  return sanitized;\n};\n\nvar valuesBySegmentCode = sanitizeValuesBySegmentCode(decision.valuesBySegmentCode);\nvar buildContextSegmentCodeValuesMapping = {};\nif (ctx.segmentCodeValuesMapping && typeof ctx.segmentCodeValuesMapping === \"object\" && !Array.isArray(ctx.segmentCodeValuesMapping)) {\n  Object.keys(ctx.segmentCodeValuesMapping).forEach(function(rawSegmentCode) {\n    var segment = resolveSegment(rawSegmentCode);\n    var segmentCode = segment && segment.segmentCode;\n    if (!segmentCode || !Array.isArray(ctx.segmentCodeValuesMapping[rawSegmentCode])) return;\n\n    var values = ctx.segmentCodeValuesMapping[rawSegmentCode]\n      .map(function(rawValue) { return String(rawValue === undefined || rawValue === null ? \"\" : rawValue).trim(); })\n      .filter(Boolean);\n    if (values.length > 0) {\n      buildContextSegmentCodeValuesMapping[segmentCode] = values;\n    }\n  });\n}\n\nvar llmSegmentCodeValuesMapping = {};\nObject.keys(valuesBySegmentCode).forEach(function(segmentCode) {\n  if (valuesBySegmentCode[segmentCode].length > 0) {\n    llmSegmentCodeValuesMapping[segmentCode] = valuesBySegmentCode[segmentCode];\n  }\n});\n\nvar segmentCodeValuesMapping = { ...buildContextSegmentCodeValuesMapping };\nObject.keys(llmSegmentCodeValuesMapping).forEach(function(segmentCode) {\n  segmentCodeValuesMapping[segmentCode] = llmSegmentCodeValuesMapping[segmentCode];\n});\n\nvar hierarchyState = { ...(ctx.hierarchyState || {}) };\n\nvar returnObj = {\n  input: ctx.input || \"\",\n  additionalContext: ctx.additionalContext || {},\n  actionCase: actionCase,\n  activeOnly: activeOnly,\n  selectedText: selectedText,\n  requestType: requestType,\n  requestedSegments: resolvedSegments,\n  valuesBySegmentCode: valuesBySegmentCode,\n  llmSegmentCodeValuesMapping: llmSegmentCodeValuesMapping,\n  buildContextSegmentCodeValuesMapping: buildContextSegmentCodeValuesMapping,\n  segmentCodeValuesMapping: segmentCodeValuesMapping,\n  hierarchyState: hierarchyState,\n  priorBusinessFlow: !!ctx.priorBusinessFlow,\n  priorBusinessAgent: ctx.priorBusinessAgent || \"\",\n  targetObject: ctx.targetObject || \"\",\n  chartOfAccountsId: String(ctx.chartOfAccountsId !== undefined && ctx.chartOfAccountsId !== null ? ctx.chartOfAccountsId : \"0\"),\n  missingCoaContext: !!ctx.missingCoaContext\n};\n\nreturn returnObj;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1779000000030"
