              "id": "1779000000060_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "# Hierarchy Selection Resolver\n\n- Return exactly one minified JSON object that matches the schema.\n- Do not return markdown.\n- Do not return extra keys.\n\n## Objective\n\n- Resolve the user's hierarchy option selection to one or more selected option candidates.\n\n## Inputs\n\n**Current User Message**\n{{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\n**Current Context**\n{{$context.$nodes.FIN_GL_CODE_BUILD_CONTEXT.$output.result.intentResolverLlmContext}}\n\n**Intent Resolver Output**\n{{$context.$nodes.FIN_GL_LLM_INTENT_RESOLVER.$output}}\n\n**Raw Chat History**\n{{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.chatHistory}}\n\n## Output Contract\n\n- Return exactly:\n{\"result\":{\"selectedOptions\":[{\"sr\":1,\"segmentCode\":\"<segmentCode>\",\"treeNameHyphenVersion\":\"<Tree Name-Version>\"}]}}\n\n- Allowed keys, exactly:\n- `result`\n- `result.selectedOptions`\n- `result.selectedOptions[].sr`\n- `result.selectedOptions[].segmentCode`\n- `result.selectedOptions[].treeNameHyphenVersion`\n\n## Field: selectedOptions\n\n- Purpose: list of hierarchy options selected by the user.\n- Return an empty array when no selection can be identified.\n- Return one item per selected segment.\n- Return at most one item per segment.\n- Each item must include all three fields: `sr`, `segmentCode`, and `treeNameHyphenVersion`.\n- Try to populate all three fields for every selected option using Current Context and Raw Chat History.\n\n### segmentCode\n\n- Find the matching `segmentCode` from Current Context `segments[]` for the selected segment.\n- Use only `segments[].segmentCode` values from Current Context.\n- Do not invent segment codes.\n- Do not return segment labels, dimension names, or aliases as `segmentCode`.\n- If the selected segment is not explicitly stated, infer it from the pending option context or the immediately relevant hierarchy-selection table when clear.\n- Return `segmentCode=\"\"` only when the segment cannot be determined.\n\n### sr\n\n- Try to match the user input to an option `sr` from pending options or the immediately relevant hierarchy-selection table.\n- Treat a hierarchy-selection table column named `Option` as the displayed row number / `sr`. For example, if the table row has `Option = 2`, then the selected option's `sr` is `2`.\n- Match numeric and ordinal selections such as `2`, `option 2`, `second`, `use 2`, `choose option 3`, `choose 3`, or `set 2`.\n- If the user selects by tree/version text, match that text to the pending option row and return that row's `sr`.\n- If no row matches or the match is ambiguous, return `sr=0`.\n\n### treeNameHyphenVersion\n\n- Try to identify the selected tree/version from pending options, the immediately relevant hierarchy-selection table, or the current user input.\n- Build `treeNameHyphenVersion` by joining the selected row's Tree Name and Version using a hyphen: `<Tree Name>-<Version>`.\n- If the selected row already has a combined tree/version value, use that value.\n- If no tree/version can be identified, return `treeNameHyphenVersion=\"\"`.\n\n\n## Examples\n\nCurrent user message: `option 2`\nRelevant hierarchy-selection table has `Option = 2` for Intercompany as `All VF Companies-V2`.\nOutput: `{\"result\":{\"selectedOptions\":[{\"sr\":2,\"segmentCode\":\"vFIntercompany\",\"treeNameHyphenVersion\":\"All VF Companies-V2\"}]}}`\n\nCurrent user message: `use 3 for Intercompany`\nRelevant hierarchy-selection table has row 3 as `Cross Tree-Cross Tree`.\nOutput: `{\"result\":{\"selectedOptions\":[{\"sr\":3,\"segmentCode\":\"vFIntercompany\",\"treeNameHyphenVersion\":\"Cross Tree-Cross Tree\"}]}}`\n\nCurrent user message: `Use Cross Tree-Cross Tree`\nRelevant hierarchy-selection table identifies this as Intercompany row 3.\nOutput: `{\"result\":{\"selectedOptions\":[{\"sr\":3,\"segmentCode\":\"vFIntercompany\",\"treeNameHyphenVersion\":\"Cross Tree-Cross Tree\"}]}}`\n\nCurrent user message: `Use All VF Companies V2 for Intercompany`\nOutput: `{\"result\":{\"selectedOptions\":[{\"sr\":0,\"segmentCode\":\"vFIntercompany\",\"treeNameHyphenVersion\":\"All VF Companies-V2\"}]}}`\n\nCurrent user message: `show balances`\nOutput: `{\"result\":{\"selectedOptions\":[]}}`"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\"$schema\":\"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"result\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"selectedOptions\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"sr\":{\"type\":\"number\"},\"segmentCode\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"treeNameHyphenVersion\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"sr\",\"segmentCode\",\"treeNameHyphenVersion\"],\"additionalProperties\":false}}},\"required\":[\"selectedOptions\"],\"additionalProperties\":false}},\"required\":[\"result\"],\"additionalProperties\":false}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Resolve Clear Selection"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1779000000069"
          },
          "code": "FIN_GL_LLM_RESOLVE_CLEAR_SELECTION",
          "id": "1779000000064",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1779000000064_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "# Hierarchy Clear Preference Resolver\n\n- Return exactly one minified JSON object that matches the schema.\n- Do not return markdown.\n- Do not return extra keys.\n\n## Objective\n\n- Resolve the current clear-preference request to the minimal clear target object.\n\n## Inputs\n\n**Current User Message**\n{{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\n**Current Context**\n{{$context.$nodes.FIN_GL_CODE_BUILD_CONTEXT.$output.result.intentResolverLlmContext}}\n\n**Intent Resolver Output**\n{{$context.$nodes.FIN_GL_LLM_INTENT_RESOLVER.$output}}\n\n**Raw Chat History**\n{{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.chatHistory}}\n\n## Output Contract\n\n- Return exactly:\n{\"result\":{\"segmentCodesToClear\":[\"<segmentCode>\"],\"clearAll\":false}}\n\n- Allowed keys, exactly:\n- `result`\n- `result.segmentCodesToClear`\n- `result.clearAll`\n\n## Field: clearAll\n\n- Set `clearAll=true` only when the current user message explicitly asks to clear:\n    - all hierarchy preferences\n    - all saved hierarchy preferences\n    - all default hierarchy preferences\n    - all segment hierarchy preferences\n\n- Set `clearAll=false` when:\n    - the user asks to clear one or more named segments\n    - the request is ambiguous\n    - no clear target can be determined\n\n## Field: segmentCodesToClear\n\n- Purpose: list of COA segments for which the user intends to clear hierarchy preferences. This field is not considered when `clearAll=true`.\n- Source of values: use only `segments[].segmentCode` values from Current Context.\n- Do not invent segment codes.\n- Do not return segment labels, dimension names, or aliases.\n\nRules:\n- If the user explicitly intends to clear all hierarchy preferences, set `clearAll=true` and keep `segmentCodesToClear=[]`.\n- If the current user input explicitly names one or more segments, return the matching canonical `segmentCode` values in user-mentioned order.\n- If the current user input does not explicitly name segments, but one or more segments are clearly implied from the immediately relevant chat history, return those canonical `segmentCode` values.\n- If no segments can be derived from the current user input or immediately relevant chat history, return `segmentCodesToClear=[]`.\n\nNote:\n- Do not map numeric text such as `2` to COA segment sequence number 2.\n- Numeric text is not a clear target.\n\n\n## Examples\n\nCurrent user message: `clear default hierarchy for Company`\nOutput: `{\"result\":{\"segmentCodesToClear\":[\"VF_Company\"],\"clearAll\":false}}`\n\nCurrent user message: `remove saved preferences for cost center and account`\nOutput: `{\"result\":{\"segmentCodesToClear\":[\"FA_COST_CTR\",\"VF_ACCOUNT\"],\"clearAll\":false}}`\n\nCurrent user message: `clear all hierarchy preferences`\nOutput: `{\"result\":{\"segmentCodesToClear\":[],\"clearAll\":true}}`\n\nCurrent user message: `clear that preference`\nRelevant history identifies Company as the active hierarchy preference.\nOutput: `{\"result\":{\"segmentCodesToClear\":[\"VF_Company\"],\"clearAll\":false}}`\n\nCurrent user message: `clear that preference`\nNo segment is implied by context or relevant history.\nOutput: `{\"result\":{\"segmentCodesToClear\":[],\"clearAll\":false}}`"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\"$schema\":\"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"result\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"segmentCodesToClear\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"clearAll\":{\"type\":\"boolean\"}},\"required\":[\"segmentCodesToClear\",\"clearAll\"],\"additionalProperties\":false}},\"required\":[\"result\"],\"additionalProperties\":false}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Resolve Session Only Selection"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1779000000068"
          },
          "code": "FIN_GL_LLM_RESOLVE_SESSION_ONLY_SELECTION",
          "id": "1779000000063",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1779000000063_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "# Hierarchy Session Only Selection Resolver\n\n- Return exactly one minified JSON object that matches the schema.\n- Do not return markdown.\n- Do not return extra keys.\n\n## Objective\n\n- Resolve which hierarchy option the user wants to use the selected hierarchy for this session only.\n- This LLM node only identifies selected option candidates.\n\n## Inputs\n\n**Current User Message**\n{{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\n**Current Context**\n{{$context.$nodes.FIN_GL_CODE_BUILD_CONTEXT.$output.result.intentResolverLlmContext}}\n\n**Intent Resolver Output**\n{{$context.$nodes.FIN_GL_LLM_INTENT_RESOLVER.$output}}\n\n**Raw Chat History**\n{{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.chatHistory}}\n\n## Output Contract\n\n- Return exactly:\n{\"result\":{\"selectedOptions\":[{\"sr\":1,\"segmentCode\":\"<segmentCode>\",\"treeNameHyphenVersion\":\"<Tree Name-Version>\"}]}}\n\n- Allowed keys, exactly:\n- `result`\n- `result.selectedOptions`\n- `result.selectedOptions[].sr`\n- `result.selectedOptions[].segmentCode`\n- `result.selectedOptions[].treeNameHyphenVersion`\n\n## Field: selectedOptions\n\n- Purpose: list of hierarchy options selected by the user for this sessionOnly commit.\n- Return an empty array when no selection can be identified.\n- Return one item per selected segment.\n- Return at most one item per segment.\n- Each item must include all three fields: `sr`, `segmentCode`, and `treeNameHyphenVersion`.\n- Try to populate all three fields for every selected option using Current Context and Raw Chat History.\n- Use `sr=0`, `segmentCode=\"\"`, or `treeNameHyphenVersion=\"\"` only when that specific value cannot be determined.\n\n### segmentCode\n\n- Find the matching `segmentCode` from Current Context `segments[]` for the selected segment.\n- Use only `segments[].segmentCode` values from Current Context.\n- Do not invent segment codes.\n- Do not return segment labels, dimension names, or aliases as `segmentCode`.\n- If the selected segment is not explicitly stated, infer it from pending selections, pending option context, or the immediately relevant hierarchy-selection table when clear.\n- Return `segmentCode=\"\"` only when the segment cannot be determined.\n\n### sr\n\n- Try to match the user input to an option `sr` from pending options or the immediately relevant hierarchy-selection table.\n- Treat a hierarchy-selection table column named `Option` as the displayed row number / `sr`. For example, if the table row has `Option = 2`, then the selected option's `sr` is `2`.\n- Match numeric and ordinal selections such as `2`, `option 2`, `second`, `use 2`, `choose option 3`, `choose 3`, `set 2`, `save option 2`, `save 2`, or `this session only for 2`.\n- If the user does not specify an option number but the immediately preceding selection already chose an option, return that selected option's `sr` when available.\n- If no row matches or the match is ambiguous, return `sr=0`.\n\n### treeNameHyphenVersion\n\n- Try to identify the selected tree/version from pending selections, pending options, the immediately relevant hierarchy-selection table, or the current user input.\n- Build `treeNameHyphenVersion` by joining the selected row's Tree Name and Version using a hyphen: `<Tree Name>-<Version>`.\n- If the selected row already has a combined tree/version value, use that value.\n- If no tree/version can be identified, return `treeNameHyphenVersion=\"\"`.\n\n## Examples\n\nCurrent user message: `Save as Default`\nImmediately preceding selection chose Intercompany row 3, `Cross Tree-Cross Tree`.\nOutput: `{\"result\":{\"selectedOptions\":[{\"sr\":3,\"segmentCode\":\"vFIntercompany\",\"treeNameHyphenVersion\":\"Cross Tree-Cross Tree\"}]}}`\n\nCurrent user message: `This Session Only`\nImmediately preceding selection chose Cost Center row 2, `Corporate Cost Center-Current`.\nOutput: `{\"result\":{\"selectedOptions\":[{\"sr\":2,\"segmentCode\":\"FA_COST_CTR\",\"treeNameHyphenVersion\":\"Corporate Cost Center-Current\"}]}}`\n\nCurrent user message: `save option 2 as default for Intercompany`\nRelevant hierarchy-selection table has `Option = 2` for Intercompany as `All VF Companies-V2`.\nOutput: `{\"result\":{\"selectedOptions\":[{\"sr\":2,\"segmentCode\":\"vFIntercompany\",\"treeNameHyphenVersion\":\"All VF Companies-V2\"}]}}`\n\nCurrent user message: `show balances`\nOutput: `{\"result\":{\"selectedOptions\":[]}}`"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\"$schema\":\"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"result\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"selectedOptions\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"sr\":{\"type\":\"number\"},\"segmentCode\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"treeNameHyphenVersion\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"sr\",\"segmentCode\",\"treeNameHyphenVersion\"],\"additionalProperties\":false}}},\"required\":[\"selectedOptions\"],\"additionalProperties\":false}},\"required\":[\"result\"],\"additionalProperties\":false}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
