              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "# Hierarchy Save Default Selection Resolver\n\n- Return exactly one minified JSON object that matches the schema.\n- Do not return markdown.\n- Do not return extra keys.\n\n## Objective\n\n- Resolve which hierarchy option the user wants to save the selected hierarchy as default.\n- This LLM node only identifies selected option candidates.\n\n## Inputs\n\n**Current User Message**\n{{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\n**Current Context**\n{{$context.$nodes.FIN_GL_CODE_BUILD_CONTEXT.$output.result.intentResolverLlmContext}}\n\n**Intent Resolver Output**\n{{$context.$nodes.FIN_GL_LLM_INTENT_RESOLVER.$output}}\n\n**Raw Chat History**\n{{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.chatHistory}}\n\n## Output Contract\n\n- Return exactly:\n{\"result\":{\"selectedOptions\":[{\"sr\":1,\"segmentCode\":\"<segmentCode>\",\"treeNameHyphenVersion\":\"<Tree Name-Version>\"}]}}\n\n- Allowed keys, exactly:\n- `result`\n- `result.selectedOptions`\n- `result.selectedOptions[].sr`\n- `result.selectedOptions[].segmentCode`\n- `result.selectedOptions[].treeNameHyphenVersion`\n\n## Field: selectedOptions\n\n- Purpose: list of hierarchy options selected by the user for this saveDefault commit.\n- Return an empty array when no selection can be identified.\n- Return one item per selected segment.\n- Return at most one item per segment.\n- Each item must include all three fields: `sr`, `segmentCode`, and `treeNameHyphenVersion`.\n- Try to populate all three fields for every selected option using Current Context and Raw Chat History.\n- Use `sr=0`, `segmentCode=\"\"`, or `treeNameHyphenVersion=\"\"` only when that specific value cannot be determined.\n\n### segmentCode\n\n- Find the matching `segmentCode` from Current Context `segments[]` for the selected segment.\n- Use only `segments[].segmentCode` values from Current Context.\n- Do not invent segment codes.\n- Do not return segment labels, dimension names, or aliases as `segmentCode`.\n- If the selected segment is not explicitly stated, infer it from pending selections, pending option context, or the immediately relevant hierarchy-selection table when clear.\n- Return `segmentCode=\"\"` only when the segment cannot be determined.\n\n### sr\n\n- Try to match the user input to an option `sr` from pending options or the immediately relevant hierarchy-selection table.\n- Treat a hierarchy-selection table column named `Option` as the displayed row number / `sr`. For example, if the table row has `Option = 2`, then the selected option's `sr` is `2`.\n- Match numeric and ordinal selections such as `2`, `option 2`, `second`, `use 2`, `choose option 3`, `choose 3`, `set 2`, `save option 2`, `save 2`, or `this session only for 2`.\n- If the user does not specify an option number but the immediately preceding selection already chose an option, return that selected option's `sr` when available.\n- If no row matches or the match is ambiguous, return `sr=0`.\n\n### treeNameHyphenVersion\n\n- Try to identify the selected tree/version from pending selections, pending options, the immediately relevant hierarchy-selection table, or the current user input.\n- Build `treeNameHyphenVersion` by joining the selected row's Tree Name and Version using a hyphen: `<Tree Name>-<Version>`.\n- If the selected row already has a combined tree/version value, use that value.\n- If no tree/version can be identified, return `treeNameHyphenVersion=\"\"`.\n\n## Examples\n\nCurrent user message: `Save as Default`\nImmediately preceding selection chose Intercompany row 3, `Cross Tree-Cross Tree`.\nOutput: `{\"result\":{\"selectedOptions\":[{\"sr\":3,\"segmentCode\":\"vFIntercompany\",\"treeNameHyphenVersion\":\"Cross Tree-Cross Tree\"}]}}`\n\nCurrent user message: `This Session Only`\nImmediately preceding selection chose Cost Center row 2, `Corporate Cost Center-Current`.\nOutput: `{\"result\":{\"selectedOptions\":[{\"sr\":2,\"segmentCode\":\"FA_COST_CTR\",\"treeNameHyphenVersion\":\"Corporate Cost Center-Current\"}]}}`\n\nCurrent user message: `save option 2 as default for Intercompany`\nRelevant hierarchy-selection table has `Option = 2` for Intercompany as `All VF Companies-V2`.\nOutput: `{\"result\":{\"selectedOptions\":[{\"sr\":2,\"segmentCode\":\"vFIntercompany\",\"treeNameHyphenVersion\":\"All VF Companies-V2\"}]}}`\n\nCurrent user message: `show balances`\nOutput: `{\"result\":{\"selectedOptions\":[]}}`"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\"$schema\":\"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"result\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"selectedOptions\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"sr\":{\"type\":\"number\"},\"segmentCode\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"treeNameHyphenVersion\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"sr\",\"segmentCode\",\"treeNameHyphenVersion\"],\"additionalProperties\":false}}},\"required\":[\"selectedOptions\"],\"additionalProperties\":false}},\"required\":[\"result\"],\"additionalProperties\":false}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Prepare Tree Version List Payload",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "var buildCtx = $context.$nodes.FIN_GL_CODE_BUILD_CONTEXT && $context.$nodes.FIN_GL_CODE_BUILD_CONTEXT.$output && $context.$nodes.FIN_GL_CODE_BUILD_CONTEXT.$output.result ? $context.$nodes.FIN_GL_CODE_BUILD_CONTEXT.$output.result : {};\nvar resolvedCtx = $context.$nodes.FIN_GL_CODE_RESOLVE_INTENT_CONTEXT && $context.$nodes.FIN_GL_CODE_RESOLVE_INTENT_CONTEXT.$output && $context.$nodes.FIN_GL_CODE_RESOLVE_INTENT_CONTEXT.$output.result ? $context.$nodes.FIN_GL_CODE_RESOLVE_INTENT_CONTEXT.$output.result : {};\nvar ctx = { ...buildCtx, ...resolvedCtx };\n\nvar requestedSegments = Array.isArray(ctx.requestedSegments) ? ctx.requestedSegments : [];\nvar llmSegmentCodeValuesMapping = resolvedCtx.llmSegmentCodeValuesMapping && typeof resolvedCtx.llmSegmentCodeValuesMapping === \"object\" && !Array.isArray(resolvedCtx.llmSegmentCodeValuesMapping)\n  ? resolvedCtx.llmSegmentCodeValuesMapping\n  : {};\nvar segmentDimensionByCode = {};\n(Array.isArray(buildCtx.segments) ? buildCtx.segments : []).forEach(function(segment) {\n  if (segment && segment.segmentCode && segment.dimensionName) {\n    segmentDimensionByCode[segment.segmentCode] = segment.dimensionName;\n  }\n});\nvar valuesByNormalizedSegment = {};\nrequestedSegments.forEach(function(segment) {\n  var segmentCode = segment && segment.segmentCode;\n  var dimensionName = segmentCode && segmentDimensionByCode[segmentCode];\n  if (dimensionName && !Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty.call(valuesByNormalizedSegment, dimensionName)) {\n    valuesByNormalizedSegment[dimensionName] = Array.isArray(llmSegmentCodeValuesMapping[segmentCode])\n      ? llmSegmentCodeValuesMapping[segmentCode].filter(Boolean)\n      : [];\n  }\n});\n\nvar activeOnlyValue = ctx.activeOnly === true || ctx.activeOnly === \"true\" ? \"true\" : \"false\";\nvar actionCase = ctx.actionCase || ctx.deterministicCase || \"outOfScope\";\nvar requestType = ctx.requestType || (actionCase === \"change\" ? \"change\" : \"list\");\n\nvar payload = {\n  chartOfAccountsId: String(ctx.chartOfAccountsId !== undefined && ctx.chartOfAccountsId !== null ? ctx.chartOfAccountsId : \"0\"),\n  targetObject: \"balances\",\n  valuesByNormalizedSegment: valuesByNormalizedSegment,\n  requestType: requestType,\n  activeOnly: activeOnlyValue\n};\n\nreturn payload;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1779000000040"
